WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:10.400
What up, homies? Welcome back to
Thug Notes.

00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:18.020
This week, we stickin it to the man with "1984" by George Orwell.

00:00:18.020 --> 00:00:24.180
"1984" focuses on Winston Smith, a mid-level member of a totalitarian regime known as "The Party."

00:00:24.180 --> 00:00:26.940
Now, the leader of this gang goes by the name of "Big Brother"

00:00:26.940 --> 00:00:31.040
and represents the po-po keepin tabs on all yo sh*t.

00:00:31.040 --> 00:00:36.040
One day, my boy Winston gets fed up with the system and starts spittin fire up in his journal.

00:00:36.040 --> 00:00:41.940
But dat fool gotta watch his self, cuz talkin smack about Big Bro is enough to get a brotha thrown in the slamma.

00:00:41.949 --> 00:00:47.780
Later, some fly hunny named Julia straight-up booty calls Winston by passin him a note that says, "I love you."

00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:49.660
Hell yeah.

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:53.260
And after a while, Winston be thinkin he got mad love for this fox.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:56.900
One day at work, Winston peeps some cat, by the name of O’Brien,

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:59.660
who seems like he wanna stick it to Big Brother, too.

00:00:59.660 --> 00:01:02.260
So, Winston brings his boo, Julia, to O'Brien’s crib,

00:01:02.260 --> 00:01:06.700
where O'Brien says that he's a part of a rebel group called "The Brotherhood."

00:01:06.700 --> 00:01:08.880
Winston be like, "Sign me up, blood."

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:12.600
One night, Winston be readin some book that O'Brien gave him when bam —

00:01:12.600 --> 00:01:16.480
the 5-O come bustin through his door and bag him and his homegirl.

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:21.320
Turns out, dat fool O'Brien was secretly part of Big Brother’s Thought Police crew.

00:01:21.320 --> 00:01:25.960
And, let me tell you somethin, home boy. These fools ain't playin.

00:01:25.960 --> 00:01:28.540
In order to realign Winston with the party’s mentality,

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:32.920
O'Brien be torturin Winston until he admit to crimes he ain't even done.

00:01:32.920 --> 00:01:38.600
Then, O'Brien be like, “Yo. We ain’t even done up in here until everything be dead inside you.

00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:42.200
And, after you empty, we gonna fill yo ass up with Big Brotha-ly love."

00:01:42.200 --> 00:01:43.900
Ain't that some sh*t?

00:01:43.900 --> 00:01:47.300
But Winston say, "Naw shorty, I keeps it real."

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:50.780
This be one of them instances where keepin it real goes wrong,

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:58.300
cuz dat boy O'Brien slings Winston's ass in the wackest torture chamber yo b*tch ass ever heard of — Room 101.

00:01:58.300 --> 00:02:04.260
So, O'Brien puts a cage full of rats all up in Winston's grill until he gives in and starts screamin,

00:02:04.260 --> 00:02:07.000
"Do it to Julia! Not me!"

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:12.780
In the end, The Man takes all the soul straight outta Winston. He only love Big Brother.

00:02:12.780 --> 00:02:16.860
Damn.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:22.440
Aight son, you don’t know nuttin about Big Brotha unless you schooled on their wackest method of control —

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:23.620
"doublethink."

00:02:23.620 --> 00:02:28.060
Let me break it down. It’s called doublethink cuz yo ass be thinkin in two ways at once.

00:02:28.060 --> 00:02:33.060
The first is you makin the conscious decision to believe something that be obvious bullsh*t.

00:02:33.060 --> 00:02:36.520
The second is when you also deny that it’s even a lie in the first place.

00:02:36.520 --> 00:02:42.340
So in the end, you's a fool who be believin nonsense with all the conviction of it actually bein true.

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:48.960
Like O'Brien book say, "Doublethink goes on forever. With the lie always one step ahead of the truth."

00:02:48.960 --> 00:02:52.860
That sh*t is ridiculous. When most ballas think about Big Brotha,

00:02:52.860 --> 00:02:56.980
they usually think about the po-po peepin yo sh*t wit informants and telescreens.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:03:00.580
But, what’s just as legit is the way The Party twists reality.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:06.120
See, if you wanna roll like a G'd up totalitarian dictator, you can’t just tear down da truth like Hitler,

00:03:06.120 --> 00:03:09.760
