00:03:09.760 --> 00:03:12.500
Naw, naw — you gotta build that sh*t back up like Stalin,

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:16.040
who actually rewrote those muthaf**kas to be in line with his flava.

00:03:16.040 --> 00:03:21.740
Orwell’s Oceania be givin nods to Stalin, who was sho as hell betta at controllin his peeps than Hitler.

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:23.320
Yo, you know what else is wack?

00:03:23.320 --> 00:03:29.140
As The Party recreates reality, eventually all yo individual qualities get kicked straight to the curb.

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:33.719
How's a brotha gonna know he exist if all he be is what the government tells him he be?

00:03:33.719 --> 00:03:40.199
But, let me be clear, son. If you think this book just be a critique of Stalinism, you best check yo self, blood.

00:03:40.200 --> 00:03:44.440
Cuz on the real, this book here is a warning for all mankind.

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:49.360
Orwell sayin, "Yo, unless we change shit up in here, we gonna become some soulless robots

00:03:49.360 --> 00:03:51.060
and not even know it.”

00:03:51.060 --> 00:03:53.100
Hey, thank you for checking out Thug Notes.

00:03:53.109 --> 00:03:56.619
Don't be a playa-hater, man — hit subscribe! See you next week.

